export PP_RBMODE=0
export PP_CORE_PLL=50M
export PP_INT_PLL=50M

Core PLL is the clock for the FPGA streamer circuit (decoder). Internal PLL generates the clock
for clocking out the date from the output FIFO buffer, i.e., it's a "data clock.

pptest 2 -int_clk -int_pll 25M -veryverbose -check
pptest 2 -ext_clk -veryverbose -check
pptest 2 -clk 2 -veryverbose -check
